## SciPy

SciPy builds on NumPy and provides more advanced scientific computing functionality.

Useful areas include:

    - Optimisation
    - Statistics
    - Signal processing
    - Numerical integration
    - Linear algebra
    - Scientific calculations

Example:

    from scipy import stats

    result = stats.norm.pdf(0)

SciPy becomes particularly useful when NumPy alone does not provide the scientific functionality you need.

